// In your existing match /commonsReports/{reportId}, replace exactly:
//   allow get, list, update, delete: if false;
// with:
//   allow get, list: if hgOwner();
//   allow update, delete: if false;
//
// Keep the existing allow create and all other rules unchanged.
// hgOwner() is already defined in the deployed moderator rules.
//
// Owner can review submitted reports. Regular members and moderators
// cannot read them. No client can change report status or delete reports.
// Decisions and immutable audit records require a separate trusted workflow.
//
